==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|инглинг|-изм||t1=[[Yngling]], a Scandinavian royal dynasty}}.

In Ynglist belief, the name refers to a fiery primordial radiance known as {{m|ru|Инглия}} emanated by the supreme god {{m|ru|Рамха}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|инглии́зм}}

===Proper noun===
{{ru-noun+|инглии́зм|n=sg}}

# {{lb|ru|religion|paganism}} [[Ynglism]], an [[esoteric]] [[neopagan]] sect from Russia.

